[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Queen's Gambit Declined"]
[Variation "Orthodox Defence, Knight Variation"]
[ECO "D37"]
[Character "solid,positional"]
[Risk "low"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "none"]
[Themes "transposition,solid-setup"]
[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Opponent "3.Nf3"]
[Start "1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6"]

3. Nf3 { White develops the knight first and keeps the choice between Nc3 and g3 for later. } 3... Nf6 4. Bg5 Be7 { The same set-up as always: bishop to e7 ends the pin, then castle. } 5. e3 ( 5. Nc3 O-O 6. e3 Nbd7 ) 5... O-O 6. Nc3 ( 6. Nbd2 Nbd7 7. Rc1 c6 ) ( 6. Qc2 Nbd7 7. Nc3 c6 ) 6... Nbd7 { The usual Queen's Gambit Declined setup, with ...c6 and ...dxc4 to come. } *
